# `/stats` 的**命令结果通道**：写入的那一刻。
#
# 通道挂在**实体**上，而上报用的是**执行命令的那个实体**的通道。
# 所以：
#   - 控制台执行命令 → 控制台没有通道 → 不写
#   - `execute @e[...] <命令>` → 盔甲架执行 → 写进盔甲架的通道
#
# 这一轮测：
#   - `execute` 让盔甲架执行查询，看分数变不变
#   - SuccessCount
#   - `clear` 之后不写
#
# 查询用 **`gamerule`**（也报 QUERY_RESULT），不用 `time query`——
# 时间每 tick 都走，基线不可复现。
#
# bot: Steve

--- console ---
say U01
scoreboard objectives add return dummy
say U02
scoreboard objectives add cnt dummy
say U03
summon armor_stand 0 4 0 {CustomName:"CH_AS"}
say U04
scoreboard players set @e[type=armor_stand] return 0
say U05
scoreboard players set @e[type=armor_stand] cnt 0
say U06
stats entity @e[type=armor_stand] set QueryResult @e[type=armor_stand] return
say U07
stats entity @e[type=armor_stand] set SuccessCount @e[type=armor_stand] cnt
say U08
execute @e[type=armor_stand] ~ ~ ~ gamerule randomTickSpeed
say U09
scoreboard players list @e[type=armor_stand]
say U10
execute @e[type=armor_stand] ~ ~ ~ setblock 5 4 5 stone
say U11
scoreboard players list @e[type=armor_stand]
say U12
stats entity @e[type=armor_stand] clear QueryResult
say U13
execute @e[type=armor_stand] ~ ~ ~ gamerule randomTickSpeed
say U14
scoreboard players list @e[type=armor_stand]
say U15
